  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Africa Commission: Joint Monitoring Unit between AfDB, AUC and UNECA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main goals of JSSO is to provide support to the Joint Secretariat, comprising the Executives of the JS institutions (AUC, ECA and AfDB) in their efforts to enhance coordination and collaboration among them, with a view of reducing fragmentation and waste of resources, as well as increasing the impact of their interventions.  

The realization of the above mentioned goals of JSSO depend on the fulfillment of three immediate objectives, namely: i) providing support to emerging joint initiatives; ii) assisting the processes of identifying new areas that require the establishment of new joint initiatives by the JSIs; and iii) building coherence and efficient coordination in joint programs and projects.</narrative>
  </description>
